  _glyph: "\U0001F463\uFE0F"
  _subtitle: The road to the Emerald City
  _description: Leads from the [[4afa4d10-195b-4b78-8315-5517131fcf9c|Munchkin Village]]
    to the [[81773492-1f02-4ad4-9a99-9d831db56088|Emerald City]], past the [[357ea1cd-74bf-410f-a1a4-f3210c673bd5|Scarecrow's
    Cornfield]] and through the [[5f1c8c7f-e38d-43c7-9e1f-218f4d2a3b6f|Tin Woodman's
    Forest]].
